Ravana reaches Indra world with roaring host --- Indra arms gods and begs Vishnu in fear --- Vishnu declines fight yet vows future death of Ravana --- Ministers led by Sumali rout god hosts --- Vasu Savitra confronts ravaging Sumali --- Savitra wrecks chariot and crushes Sumali with mace --- Rakshasas flee wailing at Sumali fall
